{"book":"John","chapter":6,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/john/6","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"After these things Jesus went over the sea of Galilee, which is the sea of Tiberias.","words":[["After",["G3326"]],["these things",["G5023"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["went",["G565"]],["over",["G4008"]],["the sea",["G2281"]],["of Galilee,",["G1056"]],["which is the sea of Tiberias.",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"And a great multitude followed him, because they saw his miracles which he did on them that were diseased.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["a great",["G4183"]],["multitude",["G3793"]],["followed",["G190"]],["him,",["G846"]],["because",["G3754"]],["they saw",["G3708"]],["his",["G846"]],["miracles",["G4592"]],["which",["G3739"]],["he did",["G4160"]],["on",["G1909"]],["them that were diseased.",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"And Jesus went up into a mountain, and there he sat with his disciples.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["went up",["G424"]],["into",["G1519"]],["a mountain,",["G3735"]],["and",["G2532"]],["there",["G1563"]],["he sat",["G2521"]],["with",["G3326"]],["his",["G846"]],["disciples.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"And the passover, a feast of the Jews, was nigh.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["the passover,",["G3957"]],["a feast",["G1859"]],["of the Jews,",["G2453"]],["was",["G2258"]],["nigh.",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"When Jesus then lifted up his eyes, and saw a great company come unto him, he saith unto Philip, Whence shall we buy bread, that these may eat?","words":[["When Jesus",["G2424"]],["then",["G3767"]],["lifted up",["G1869"]],["his eyes,",["G3788"]],["and",["G2532"]],["saw",["G2300","G3754"]],["a great",["G4183"]],["company",["G3793"]],["come",["G2064"]],["unto",["G4314"]],["him,",["G846"]],["he saith",["G3004"]],["unto",["G4314"]],["Philip,",["G5376"]],["Whence",["G4159"]],["shall we buy",["G59"]],["bread,",["G740"]],["that",["G2443"]],["these",["G3778"]],["may eat?",[]]]},{"verse":6,"text":"And this he said to prove him: for he himself knew what he would do.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["this",["G5124"]],["he said",["G3004"]],["to prove",["G3985"]],["him:",["G846"]],["for",["G1063"]],["he himself",["G846"]],["knew",["G1492"]],["what",["G5101"]],["he would",["G3195"]],["do.",[]]]},{"verse":7,"text":"Philip answered him, Two hundred pennyworth of bread is not sufficient for them, that every one of them may take a little.","words":[["Philip",["G5376"]],["answered",["G611"]],["him,",["G846"]],["Two hundred",["G1250"]],["pennyworth",["G1220"]],["of bread",["G740"]],["is",["G714"]],["not",["G3756"]],["sufficient",["G714"]],["for them,",["G846"]],["that",["G2443"]],["every one",["G1538"]],["of them",["G846"]],["may take",["G2983"]],["a",["G5100"]],["little.",[]]]},{"verse":8,"text":"One of his disciples, Andrew, Simon Peter’s brother, saith unto him,","words":[["One",["G1520"]],["of",["G1537"]],["his",["G846"]],["disciples,",["G3101"]],["Andrew,",["G406"]],["Simon",["G4613"]],["Peter’s brother,",["G80"]],["saith",["G3004"]],["unto him,",[]]]},{"verse":9,"text":"There is a lad here, which hath five barley loaves, and two small fishes: but what are they among so many?","words":[["There is",["G2076"]],["a",["G1520"]],["lad",["G3808"]],["here,",["G5602"]],["which",["G3739"]],["hath",["G2192"]],["five",["G4002"]],["barley",["G2916"]],["loaves,",["G740"]],["and",["G2532"]],["two",["G1417"]],["small fishes:",["G3795"]],["but",["G235"]],["what",["G5101"]],["are",["G2076"]],["they",["G5023"]],["among",["G1519"]],["so many?",[]]]},{"verse":10,"text":"And Jesus said, Make the men sit down. Now there was much grass in the place. So the men sat down, in number about five thousand.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["said,",["G2036"]],["Make",["G4160"]],["the men",["G444"]],["sit down.",["G377"]],["Now",["G1161"]],["there was",["G2258"]],["much",["G4183"]],["grass",["G5528"]],["in",["G1722"]],["the place.",["G5117"]],["So",["G3767"]],["the men",["G435"]],["sat down,",["G377"]],["in number",["G706"]],["about",["G5616